    "body": "@domenic  this also occurs during fragment navigation via `navigation.back()` and `navigation.forward()`. In that case, we enter apply the history step through apply the push or replace history step via [perform a navigation api traversal](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#performing-a-navigation-api-traversal) step 12.4\r\n\r\nAnd it also happens from `navigation.navigate(location.href + \"#1\", { history: \"push\" })` through [navigate to a fragment](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#navigate-fragid) step 18.1 which does the push or replace history step through [finalize a same document navigation](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsing-the-web.html#navigate-fragid) step 6.",
